258: ### Objective
259: Replace the previous "minimize into infinity" mechanic ($scale \to 0.001$, $Z \to -16$) with a smooth, continuous vertical 3D parallax scroll animation inspired by [Henrietta (Tattoo Digital)](https://henrietta.wearetattoodigital.com/), preserving full card scale and establishing an unbroken filmic flow as the user scrolls vertically.
